Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "Urban Intersection with Vehicle" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .
:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasActor :vehicle1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :clearWeather ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 .
:vehicle1 a :Vehicle .
:clearWeather a :ClearCondition .
:risk1 a :CollisionRisk ;
    :description "Vehicle near intersection poses risk of collision" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .
:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .
```

Identified Risks for each risk class
